WEBVTT

00:00:15.596 --> 00:00:18.757
Training → Coach: your AI coach's advice, knowledge, rules, memory and tasks.

00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:24.481
With today's advice you see the second opinion of an advisory AI coach, and where it differs. In the messages below it has its own label.

00:00:24.531 --> 00:00:29.093
Every advice is named after the day it is for, with when and why it came: the evening preview is the advice for tomorrow.

00:00:29.143 --> 00:00:34.562
Open a workout in an advice to see its steps.

00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:40.214
Once a workout is done, its name takes you to the activity.

00:00:40.264 --> 00:00:45.759
A plan change says why, and under Details what changed. A copy to intervals.icu is not a plan change and is not listed here.

00:00:45.809 --> 00:00:51.412
Earlier versions of today are listed below, with the time and why the advice changed. An older version is marked replaced.

00:00:51.462 --> 00:00:57.525
Every notice opens exactly the advice it is about, with the day, when and why. When that is an older version, it says so, with a link to the current advice.

00:00:57.575 --> 00:01:00.752
Settings: turn your AI coach on and choose an AI provider.

00:01:00.802 --> 00:01:04.339
Paste your own API key here and choose 'Save key'.

00:01:04.389 --> 00:01:07.894
New data makes a new version of the advice during the day. Choose how many updates a day at most; you see what that costs.

00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:12.491
Contact window: when an AI coach may reach you, from 7 to 23 by default. Outside it the advice is still made, but notices wait until the window opens.

00:01:12.541 --> 00:01:20.050
Per task you set when your AI coach runs, for example the morning advice at 7.

00:01:20.100 --> 00:01:27.262
Memory: how your AI coach talks and what it remembers. Everything saves by itself.

00:01:27.312 --> 00:01:33.479
Under 'What to remember' each note is one line; tap it to edit. A fixed day simply goes in the text.

00:01:33.529 --> 00:01:38.145
Knowledge: the articles your AI coach relies on. You approve changes.

00:01:38.195 --> 00:01:50.156
Log: every change in what your AI coach knows, to look back on.
